    skos:historyNote "anganwadi_premises -> anganwadi_yn: same question (DCF 1.41 in 2021-22, 1.39 in 2022-23, identical wording) and the same value distribution: 2 appears 656,872 then 658,521 times, 9 then 1 then 0 follow in the same order"@en .

