    dct:isPartOf "facility_data" ;
    dct:temporal "2018-19/2025-26" ;
    dct:valid "2018-19, 2019-20, 2020-21, 2021-22, 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, 2025-26" ;
    skos:definition "Does the School have Toilet(s)/Urinal(s)? — Whether incinerator is available in Girl’s toilet?"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "One measurement under more than one column name. Join the versions below to build a series across the rename."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Both names are cells of one printed grid, unchanged across the break."@en ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:facility_data.urinal_girls ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:facility_data.urinla_girls ;
    skos:historyNote "urinla_girls -> urinal_girls: the Girls cell of DCF item 2.5(a)(iii) 'Total number of urinals available'. The grid is identical in the 2021-22 and 2022-23 forms, headings and rows alike. The Boys cell settles the pair on its own: urinal_boys is spelled correctly in all eight releases and never changes, while only the Girls cell carries 'urinla' from 2018-19 to 2021-22. The 2022-23 release corrects it"@en .

udise:series.facility_data.ict_lab a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme udise:scheme ;
