    skos:definition "Is ICT Lab available in the school?"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "One measurement under more than one column name. Join the versions below to build a series across the rename."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "The Data Capture Format asks the same question in both years."@en ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:facility_data.ict_lab ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:facility_data.ict_lab_yn ;
    skos:historyNote "ict_lab -> ict_lab_yn: DCF item 2.27 'Is ICT Lab available in the school?' is word for word identical in 2021-22 and 2022-23. The question did not move. The Ministry's release description did: it narrows the shared column to 'ICT Lab available in school under Samagra Siksha', a restriction the form does not carry"@en .

udise:series.teacher_data.total_teacher a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme udise:scheme ;
    skos:prefLabel "total_teacher (series)"@en ;
    dct:isPartOf "teacher_data" ;
    dct:temporal "2018-19/2025-26" ;
    dct:valid "2018-19, 2019-20, 2020-21, 2021-22, 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, 2025-26" ;
    skos:definition "Number of Teaching Staff In-position"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "One measurement under more than one column name. Join the versions below to build a series across the rename."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Both names are cells of one printed grid, unchanged across the break."@en ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:teacher_data.total_tch ;
    dct:hasVersion udise:teacher_data.total_teacher ;
    skos:historyNote "total_teacher -> total_tch: DCF item 3.2 'Number of Teaching Staff In-position' carries a grid whose right-hand column is headed 'Total Number of Teaching Staff'. The item and the heading are identical in the 2021-22 and 2022-23 forms. The Ministry's schema describes the pair as 'Total Number of Teacher' and then 'No. of teachers in school'. An earlier version of this entry said no form item stated the count. That was wrong, and Codex caught it: the search had used the phrasings 'total number of teachers' and 'teachers in position', and the form says 'Teaching Staff In-position'"@en .

