udise:facility_data.pseudocode a skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme udise:scheme ;
    skos:broader udise:section-2 ;
    dct:identifier "facility_data.pseudocode" ;
    skos:prefLabel "pseudocode"@en ;
    skos:notation "pseudocode" ;
    dct:isPartOf "facility_data" ;
    dct:temporal "2022-23/2025-26" ;
    dct:valid "2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25, 2025-26" ;
    dct:provenance "Shared 2022-23 to 2025-26 as bigint, described as “pseudocode Code(Unique Identity No. of school)”"@en ;
    dct:isVersionOf udise:series.facility_data.psuedocode ;
    skos:altLabel "psuedocode"@en ;
    skos:historyNote "{\"at\": \"2021-22 to 2022-23\", \"action\": \"RENAME\", \"from\": \"psuedocode\", \"to\": \"pseudocode\", \"basis\": \"the pseudonymised school identifier, spelled 'psuedocode' to 2021-22 and 'pseudocode' from 2022-23. The Ministry's schema types both as bigint and describes them as the unique identity number of the school\", \"similarity\": null, \"confidence\": \"confirmed\", \"how\": \"release\"}"@en ;
    skos:note "pseudocode-stability: The release withholds the 11-digit UDISE code and substitutes a pseudocode. Arun C. Mehta warns that the pseudocode is not stable: 'even the pseudo ID is not unique as during the next year's UDISE+ data collection, the school may be allotted another pseudo-Id'."@en ;
    skos:note "spelling-of-the-key: UDISE spells the school key `psuedocode` before 2022-23. It spells it `pseudocode` after. A unioned table holds both columns. Each column is null in the other era."@en .

