    skos:note "meaning-change: Management code 7 reads 'Minority Affairs Dept.' in DCF 2021-22. It reads 'Partially Govt. Aided' in DCF 2025-26. Minority Affairs moves to code 89."@en ;
    skos:note "unmapped-codes: DCF 2021-22 item 1.15(a) prints code 8 as Unrecognized and code 98 as Madarsa Unrecognized. The 2025-26 form drops both from its printed list. 21,330 schools still report them."@en .

